invariant: INV-73
file: src/tcp_read.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: a connected session keeps the first part of a split post-handshake
  message in cfg.buf, as ch_read did before decision 247, so a connected
  session writes a buffer it gave back.

--- old
    memmove(w->p + end - left, run + used, left);
--- new
    memmove(t->cfg.buf, run + used, left);
